msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680136"
msgid "This is my assigned seat.\nThe top of it is a little bit chipped,\nso I can tell right away if it's moved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680244"
msgid "This is where #C236196003Shinji#CDEF sits.\nThere's nothing in his desk.\nEssentially, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's desk is neatly organized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680380"
msgid "It's a desk that reflects\nthe obsessive-compulsive #C236196003Shinji#CDEF well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680460"
msgid "This is the desk assigned to #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nThe desk is the same as everyone else's,\nbut the rest of the stationary he uses\nare probably luxury goods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680620"
msgid "The blackboard has been thoroughly cleared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680664"
msgid "Someone's hiding under the desk……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680704"
msgid "……yeah, like that would happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680740"
msgid "Wha―― That you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nOh thank God, finally someone who gets\nwhat I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680848"
msgid "As soon as he sees me, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's face starts to glow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680920"
msgid "He's barely said anything yet,\nbut just from his gestures I could tell that he's the\nsame #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF I saw in the \"previous school building.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681080"
msgid "Even if that \"previous school building\" was a dream I had,\nthe actors in that dream were projections of those\nthat had I met in the \"real preliminaries.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681236"
msgid "It's safe to say that this #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has\nthe same personality as I remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681328"
msgid "So, same thing for you? When you came to,\nyou found yourself in this school building?\nHey, have you seen any sort of exit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681452"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's question with a shake of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681520"
msgid "I explained that I had just woken up in this\nold school building, so I had yet to see an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681616"
msgid "Shinji talks the same way he usually does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681660"
msgid "I know he's saying rude things,\nbut I don't feel any animosity towards him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681736"
msgid "It looks like I've gotten TOO used to his\nelitism and self-consciousness from my dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681824"
msgid "…also, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF really IS brilliant, despite how he looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681900"
msgid "Just like #C236196003Leo#CDEF asked of me,\nlet's try scouting him for the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681992"
msgid "Huh? Student Council?\nTeam up and work together so we can\nescape from here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682068"
msgid "Ha! No way! A Student Council isn't worth\na damn. If everyone wants to get all chummy\nto escape, then go right on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682192"
msgid "I'm a genius, you know.\nI don't work with commoners.\nI won't ask for anyone's help, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682284"
msgid "More importantly, this is the first I've\nheard of #C236196003Leo#CDEF being here! I despise that guy.\nSo smug. All cool and calm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682416"
msgid "If #C236196003Leo#CDEF got the boot and I'd be made President,\nI'd consider it. Until then,\ndon't come to me for anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682548"
msgid "…he ended up rejecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682576"
msgid "But just what does #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nthink he's going to do all on his own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682660"
msgid "I know he's not great at making friends,\nbut I don't think it's smart to act tough\nin a situation like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682772"
msgid "Let's put that aside. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\ndo you remember the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682872"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682924"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683088"
msgid "The only real feeling I have left\nis the firm bond I have with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683176"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683228"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683392"
msgid "Obviously, being a Master and all, I reply.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683512"
msgid "…yeah, sort of, I answer with little confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683564"
msgid "…gone. Apparently, we got separated\non the way here. Well, once I return to the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'll come back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683704"
msgid "…that's right, I need to hurry up and get back\nto the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.#RUBS         I'm#RUBE Her Master's#REND not there.\nThat woman must be lonely in some dumb way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683888"
msgid "Besides, I'm sure the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's still on.\nIf you're not on the final battlefield in\nseven days, you lose by default, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684036"
msgid "A #C000246204seven day period#CDEF…\nA #C000246204final battlefield#CDEF… \nA #C000246204loss by absence#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684148"
msgid "When I heard that, I remembered it too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684188"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is a tournament with seven rounds.\nFirst, an opponent is decided for you.\nAfter seven days of preparation,\nyou go to the final battlefield and fight the enemy Master.\nThose are the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684412"
msgid "Naturally, losing this fight means elimination.\nNot reaching the final battlefield is also \"defeat.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684516"
msgid "Ridiculous. Worst comes to worst,\nall you have to do is log out.\nIt's an old scare tactic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684608"
msgid "Sure, that could be how the final selection\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is.\nWorst comes to worst, you can just drop your connection\nand return to your body on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684784"
msgid "…however, they say that not a single #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND who\nwent up to the Moon has ever returned from that cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684940"
msgid "And――The real problem is that we're\nin this school building, unable to get out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685024"
msgid "W-what's with that gloomy look on your face!?\nThere's probably just no connection\nbetween here and the surface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685136"
msgid "What? The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a Brain of God, right?\nThen it'll help us soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685232"
msgid "You're so damn persistent.\nA friendly little Student Council isn't\nmy thing. Can't you bother someone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685340"
msgid "…like I thought,\nit sounds like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no intention of joining either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685432"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked around the\nschool building from top to bottom,\nbut I haven't gotten very good responses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685552"
msgid "Let's stop by the Student Council Room to report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685628"
msgid "First, we visit the Student Council.\nIf we all come up with another plan,\na way to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF may arise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685748"
msgid "Or rather, we'll find a way.\nThough it's only chess, losing over and over\ngoes against every fiber of my being!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685860"
msgid "About our issue with #C236196003Rani#CDEF: what if we challenge\nher to a game other than chess? I'm confident\nthat I'm second to none in Hanafuda…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686008"
msgid "Did we have games with pieces back in\nancient Uruk, you ask? The answer is obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686092"
msgid "All of humanity's intellectual property, from\nall origins, come from my stores. That #C236196003King of\nConquerors#CDEF' library only imitates mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686244"
msgid "Heeeeeeeey!\nIt SURE DOES look like my time to shine, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686304"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003Shinji#CDEF…!?\nWhere did you come from…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686364"
msgid "I was here the whole time!\nDo you know how many minutes\nI've been waiting here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686448"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, you… were waiting for me,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686548"
msgid "Why on Earth―― Well, that's what I would say,\nbut it's not really that strange.\nMaybe he was spying on the Student Council again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686680"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686792"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?\nAh, except for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686948"
msgid "I don't feel like joining in on your\npointless floundering, but I can't just\nignore a classmate in trouble, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687068"
msgid "It won't hurt to show off what this\nNo. 1 Game Champ of Asia is made of.\nI'll lend you a hand, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687188"
msgid "Oh my. I sense an indescribable vigor from this\nman… Listen, Praetor. Could this be the first\ntime he's been useful in his entire life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687328"
msgid "…I won't give him points for eavesdropping,\nbut it's good that he volunteered to cooperate.\nLet's see what he's got, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687460"
msgid "――――Hm.\nThough minuscule, I felt #ROFS0001#RUBSkingliness#RUBEan aura#REND……\nCould this \"#C236196003Shinji#CDEF\" be the King of Buffoons?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687604"
msgid "Hmph. As usual, your Servant always\nhas something to say. Just you wait and see―\nthis time I'll show you how awesome I am…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687732"
msgid "…hey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nHave your Servant and I\never spoken to each other before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687820"
msgid "Hey now, that Servant of yours\nhas a real sharp set of eyes on him!\nHe's all golden and looks tough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687924"
msgid "…whatever. Anyway, go on over to #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll be on standby in\nthe Student Council Room, got it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688040"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is full of energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688084"
msgid "Let's trust in the Game Champ's skills\nand try challenging #C236196003Rani#CDEF once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688176"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is standing in front of the room.\nBy the looks of it,\nit seems he wants to talk to me about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688304"
msgid "Ever since the whole affair with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF has become increasingly obstinate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688424"
msgid "I wonder what #C236196003Shinji#CDEF wants to talk to me about,\nin spite of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688508"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's been keeping me in the loop.\nYou saw just how outclassed you are,\nyet you still went into HER Labyrinth, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688644"
msgid "Not only did she treat me like a worm,\nshe even went and nano-sized me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688720"
msgid "If you had left me there, I'd be\nliquid nutrients for that #ROFS0002#RUBSSakura#RUBE#C236196003AI#CDEF#REND right about now.\nThinking about it makes me shudder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688884"
msgid "…so, how'd it go?\nYou entered her Labyrinth, so you fought her,\nright? Show me your battle logs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688984"
msgid "He doesn't know about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nfighting style or her #C000246204invincibility#CDEF skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689096"
msgid "How about we show him our previous data?\nThis man is a rather persistent one.\nHe'll keep asking and asking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689204"
msgid "Please show him our last battle records.\nWe might even get… probably nothing out of it,\nconsidering it's this guy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689320"
msgid "*sigh* We haven't a single grain of obligation\nto tell you anything, but having you follow us\naround is SO annoying… Go ahead, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689460"
msgid "It would clearly be in vain to do so, but\nthere's always a possibility. If all he desires\nis the battle data, then give it to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689592"
msgid "Urged on by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nI share my impressions of the time we were assaulted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689680"
msgid "Huh…?\nI knew about Drain, but what's up with that\n\"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF\"? Is she really invincible?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689792"
msgid "I can at least say that she nullified\neverything we threw at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689860"
msgid "Maybe she just has high defense,\nand if we get our attack stat up, we can break through…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689952"
msgid "…all we can do is hope that's the case\nand head to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690020"
msgid "You've got some guts heading into\nthe Labyrinth with her after you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690092"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF both have awful personalities,\nbut SHE'S even worse than awful. You'll get\nslaughtered without mercy if she finds you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690264"
msgid "And you're going to beat THAT?\nDid #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the others come up\nwith some sort of strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690376"
msgid "They're coming up with one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690404"
msgid "But the hole #C236196003Leo#CDEF left behind is a big one.\nAll the work keeps piling up solely on #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690548"
msgid "I have no choice but to find a countermeasure\nfor #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF within the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690648"
msgid "…unbelievable.\nAre you seriously not scared? You do realize\nwe have no chance of winning, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690748"
msgid "Yet you're still going to defy #C236196003BB#CDEF?\n…the Near Side of the Moon\nain't that great a place, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690864"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was an actual slaughterfest.\nEven if we make it back,\nwe'll either live or die. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690992"
msgid "I don't hear any of the usual bravado in #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691068"
msgid "In his own way, he's speaking his mind.\nHe's expressing his raw apprehensions without any pretense."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "691168"
msgid "I still have to get back to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "691212"
msgid "…to be honest, I'm scared too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691248"
msgid "…it's not that you want to go back,\nit's that you have to…\nWhat's the deal with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691336"
msgid "You're just #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhen did you start walking around,\nacting like a hero?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691428"
msgid "That stuff about the end of humanity?\nIt's a load of bull.\nShe's totally just talking it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691524"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is fundamentally the same as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, right?\nSo it's fine. No way she's capable of\ndoing something that heinous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691672"
msgid "That's right, you should be.\nYou're up against a monster out to dominate\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. No one can blame us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691800"
msgid "You wouldn't be you otherwise, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nThe fate of the world, protecting the Moon――\nIt's got nothing to do with us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691936"
msgid "…looks like my answer didn't get through to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692008"
msgid "No matter what I say,\nthere are no words that will make #C236196003Shinji#CDEF feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692100"
msgid "That's something every person left in the\nold school building has in common, not just #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692212"
msgid "The ones remaining are those who stifle such thoughts\nand struggle on, and those who can no longer struggle on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692324"
msgid "A-anyway, that's all I wanted to talk about.\nI want nothing to do with all this pointless\nfloundering about you're all doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692452"
msgid "I just got―you know―a bone to pick with HER.\nI was curious about what's been going on.\nThat's all this was, really!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692572"
msgid "…you heard me? DON'T.\nIf you value your life, then do nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692636"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF leaves, like he was holding back his frustration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692712"
msgid "…don't go into the Labyrinth.\nIf we just stick to the old school building, we'll be safe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692804"
msgid "…it's absurd to imagine, but:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692836"
msgid "maybe if we did as she said, our situation\nwouldn't have changed, and no one would've disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692936"
msgid "It would've been like sleeping in an empty cradle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692988"
msgid "We wouldn't have known about the outside world's destruction.\nMaybe we would've slept as much as we wanted\nwithin this sunset school forever――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693136"
msgid "But I've seen #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF go through\nthe cherry tree with that dinky face of #[his][hers]#.\nI need some info, stat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693264"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's in front of the Student Council Room.\nHe's trying to peek inside by looking for gaps in the curtains\none-by-one, unaware that I'm standing right behind him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "693448"
msgid "Your face looks as sorry as ever, #[huh][doesn't it]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693504"
msgid "\"Why?\" you ask……\nI AM involved in the Student Council,\nso of course I'd come through here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693600"
msgid "And why're you here, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nCould it be that you relate with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG1#CDEF?\nSo, despite speaking ill of the Student Council,\nyou're actually interest――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693800"
msgid "I mean, giving up on someone as uber talented\nas me after getting rejected one time?\nStudent Council messed up big time there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693928"
msgid "Like, do you really think I'M obligated\nto help them in any way? After all,\nthis problem'll go away if I just wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694044"
msgid "That's why I'm only keeping an eye on you guys\nso you don't do anything excessive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694128"
msgid "I see……\nWould've been great if #C236196003Shinji#CDEF joined the Student Council,\nbut if he doesn't want to, he doesn't want to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694260"
msgid "Guess I'll keep doing whatever I can,\njust like I always have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694324"
msgid "How could you accept that so easily?\nCan't you…… do better than that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694400"
msgid "You really are a dunce, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI really wanna see how you go about\ngetting your Student Council business done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694528"
msgid "Dumbass―― That wasn't what I…!\nSarcasm! That was SARCASM!\nDon't you get it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694608"
msgid "Arrrgh, whatever! No matter how many times\nyou invite me, it's not like I'd ever join\nyour little Student Council! Never ever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694736"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF left while shouting at me.\n……I feel that somewhere in his heart,\nhe's got something similar to that aspect of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694896"
msgid "If I ever get stuck when I'm looking around,\nI might be able to ask #C236196003Shinji#CDEF for advice…… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695012"
msgid "Money? Come on #[man][girl]#,\nI already told you I wasn't gonna help out!\nWhy would I start handing out money?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695124"
msgid "Besides, I'm the one strapped for some cash!\nI can't use my #RUBS  PPT#RUBEmoney#REND from the Near Side,\nand I can't find any extra memory anywhere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695276"
msgid "I don't have a Servant, so it'd be ridiculous\nfor me to start farming mats!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695352"
msgid "…huff, huff… I did it…\nI was right all along… It takes a genius\nto know a genius… That's how it is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695460"
msgid "Now I can survive…\nThis'll end without me dying…\nNo, if I pull this off, I can…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695544"
msgid "S-sorry about that. Just thinking about\nsome things. Looks like you're doing alright.\nYou insisted on surviving, again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695664"
msgid "So, what are you all going to do now?\nYou were calling it the \"Student Council,\"\nbut #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF got done in, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695816"
msgid "There's no way out of this now, right?\nAll you, #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF can do now\nis whatever #C236196003BB#CDEF says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695964"
msgid "How about accepting it and preparing for\nher recommendation to surrender? Ya never know,\nshe might spare you, if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696092"
msgid "……#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF? She should still be in the #C000246204garden#CDEF.\nGo meet her if you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696200"
msgid "In the first place, only second-rates\nhang out in stuff like Student Councils.\nI'll show you how I do things on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696320"
msgid "When the time comes to escape,\nI'll do you a favor and call out only to you,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Be thankful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696436"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is also here in this school#REND, right?\nMaybe I'll pay her a visit later.\nI'm a bit worried, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696564"
msgid "Huh? You're going to the Arena?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? You're able to go in\nthrough the schoolyard's cherry tree?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696696"
msgid "So #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is the culprit\nbehind this weird situation, right?\nMan, what the hell is she doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696808"
msgid "Don't tell me, was she so scared of losing\nto me that she ran from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nAww, that's actually kinda cute!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696944"
msgid "Ohh, #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh? Making walls in the Labyrinth\nout of the walls in people's hearts?\nWhat kind of shady joke is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697076"
msgid "It's fine to ignore stuff like other people's\nfeelings. If there's an impassable wall,\nwhy not just smash it to pieces?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697196"
msgid "I met with #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF.\nI'm glad that she's alright.\nYeah, Teach's as nice as ever……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697300"
msgid "…hmph. Couldn't find an exit\nno matter how hard I searched.\nBut help should be coming soon, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697400"
msgid "No way would the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF abandon me.\nOnly idiots run around risking their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697500"
msgid "Then again, fussing over things like that\nis just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697592"
msgid "What's up with that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF…!?\nThe nerve to hack our five senses and tout\nher shitty AI self as someone important…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697728"
msgid "Shit, I can't stop shaking……\n'cause of that violent hack,\nI still can't feel my arms n' legs yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697832"
msgid "She honestly thinks she can make\na fool out of me! If I just had #C236196003Rider#CDEF,\nI'd blow that bitch away!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697948"
msgid "And what's with \"#C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF,\" huh?\nShe making fun of me!?\nI'd rather she just picked one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698060"
msgid "Pfft. That's great.\nYou'll be needing my help soon, I'm guessing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698128"
msgid "She called herself #C236196003Matou#CDEF all on her own.\nShe's not my little sister or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698228"
msgid "…I guess she is pretty quiet and\nunderstanding. It's not like I hate her type…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698312"
msgid "But, uh, isn't she a little scary?\nLike she's a landmine, or has a scary smile…?\nAnyways, I'm not related to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698428"
msgid "This uniform? Yeah, when I came to\nI was in this uniform. Probably got it\naround the time I arrived in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698544"
msgid "Since it's got the same performance,\nI don't really care if the design is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698632"
msgid "But… I never wore anything like a uniform\nuntil I joined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698728"
msgid "…h-hmmph. Having fun, aren't you\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF, huh…\nIt's a very \"adult\" taste…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698856"
msgid "Huh!? N-nah, I just happened to overhear it!\nI don't even go near the Student Council Room,\nokay!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698956"
msgid "Hmph. Keeping your nose on the grindstone, huh?\nYou being a pleb and all,\nhonest, hard work is right up your alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699072"
msgid "Will the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF come to save us first,\nor will you guys clear the Labyrinth first?\nI'll be watching to see what happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699212"
msgid "But just you wait. No doubt that, one day,\nI'll give her a run for her money in chess!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699300"
msgid "Hehe. My father taught me how to play chess\nwhen I was five years old."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699372"
msgid "At last, it's time for the main act.\nTHAT means it's #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF's turn.\nI'll show you what I can do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699492"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699568"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?\nAh, other than #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699696"
msgid "…don't finish your sentence, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou need my help, right?\nI'll do it, I'll play some chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699812"
msgid "…the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF still isn't coming, huh…\nCould it be…\nIt's really not coming to save us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699920"
msgid "Shit…! That \"#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\"\ndoesn't give a damn even if you're outside\nthe Student Council Room!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700032"
msgid "Ugh… Sorry, I feel awful right now…\nNever even got nauseous when I was playing\n3D FPS games…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700128"
msgid "Things are looking real dodgy now…\nYou really gonna be alright? If it's too much,\nisn't this a good time to throw in the towel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700260"
msgid "W-well, whatever. Do what you want.\nYou're all hogging the Student Council Room,\nso it's your job to find the exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700376"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF's skill can open up Shields in\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, right? I knew #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF\nwas different from the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700544"
msgid "…but that Servant is the worst.\nI went to talk to #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF, and he tore me\nopen a new one with his criticisms!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700676"
msgid "Agh! It pisses me off so much!\nHe looks pretty similar to me on the outside,\nso who does he think he is!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700784"
msgid "Stolen memories?\nI guess if you say you'll give them to me,\nI'll take 'em off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700876"
msgid "But is it really alright? If you recall\nmemories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you might\nend up bawling your eyes out, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701028"
msgid "After all, I've been kicking asses without\ntaking names, so I must've had you checkmated!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701120"
msgid "Nah, nah. It's all good. Even when we\nget our memories back, we're still pals.\nI'll treat you like I have been up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701248"
msgid "Yeah… I'm winning again and again…\nOf course I'll keep winning…\nI'm the top pick of this tournament…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701356"
msgid "But… #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF are saying different\nthings… Imaginary number spaces, the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF…\n…why the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF won't intervene…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701552"
msgid "…no, I better stop. If I think about it\ntoo seriously, I'll have nightmares…\nIt can't be… it can't…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701660"
msgid "Listen here. I know plebs envy the talented.\nAnd I'm an adult, so I'll\nlet this be water under the bridge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701768"
msgid "But come on! Is there no way everyone can\nSTOP FORGETTING about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701840"
msgid "Even in the Student Council Room,\nmy name NEVER gets brought up!\nYou can't exclude people, it's not nice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701948"
msgid "No need for me to even lift a finger.\nYou'll wipe the floor with that nasty AI\nfor us in no time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702056"
msgid "W-was someone outta this world in the schoolyard\njust now!? They had a Spiritron structure\nbeyond a Servant's―the hell are they…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702192"
msgid "Since you have a Servant with you,\nyou're obligated to fight in my place.\nJust don't go dying in vain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702296"
msgid "Huh? You're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? That's a strategy even\nI wouldn't be able to manage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702436"
msgid "If you're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, then you'd have\na hell of an easier time taking one of\nthose trees in the schoolyard, instead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702576"
msgid "Hmph. Wondering about what I'm doing here?\nI'm not exactly staring at the sunset\nand getting all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702680"
msgid "This spot gets good reception. I can't take\nover the old school's system, it's being\nmanaged by the Student Council and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702824"
msgid "But, though slowly, I can gather Sakurament\nwhen I stand here! Geniuses don't need to even\nlift a finger, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702936"
msgid "Just you wait, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWith all the power source I'll stockpile,\nI'll whip up a special #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF#RUBS  technique#RUBE program#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703104"
msgid "You're not shrewd enough to know to run\nfrom a situation like that.\nYou must've had no choice… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703208"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, huh…\nShe's an oddball, but she's still a Game Champ.\nShe won't go down so easy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703324"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWord is you're going to break open\nthat memory data you got."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703416"
msgid "…#C000246204let's go to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nYou're the only people I don't want getting\na one-up on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703532"
msgid "Aww, damn… damn… damn…!\nI should've never gone through with it\nif THIS was going to happen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703628"
msgid "…didn't I tell you not to talk to me?\nCan you not remember squat, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703720"
msgid "Ha! You can't, can you!\nYou remembered everything BUT yourself!\nIt's plastered all over your face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703820"
msgid "MAN. Same old, same old, huh!?\nYou're such a wimp that it pisses me off,\nso take a hike in the Labyrinth or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703940"
msgid "That explains why she had over 6,000 hours\nof playtime in FA. The Total Champ turned out\nto be a pretty lonely person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704060"
msgid "Damn! Now I went and remembered it again!\nI was finally starting to calm down, too!\nDamn it, damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704164"
msgid "I'm not like him. I'm special.\nI'm going to get out of this alive,\nno matter what…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704252"
msgid "………what is it? Can't you see me\nthinking here? If you want some friends,\nhow about you try the Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704372"
msgid "Yo, if it isn't #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nGood job crawling back out of rock bottom.\nSo, what's the plan now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704480"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is gone and #C236196003Julius#CDEF is gone.\nWe have no chance of winning, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704584"
msgid "Well, if it comes to that,\nwe'll be living like chained slaves, though!\nHahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704664"
msgid "I knew the differences between\nplebs and geniuses, but THIS was REAL cruel.\nWoe to the unchosen guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704768"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is dead…?\nYou're joking… #C236196003BB#CDEF said as long as we don't\noppose her, she won't kill us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704900"
msgid "Shit! So that's how it is!?\nIn the end, we're all going to… Damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704972"
msgid "I know. Not only was I useless,\nbut on top of betraying you,\nI proactively got in your way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705064"
msgid "I'm the very definition of a silly clown!\nEnough, please stop treating me like an ally!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705152"
msgid "C'mon, please stay away from me!\nI'm the one turning down your pity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705224"
msgid "Like I said yesterday,\ndon't go to the Labyrinth anymore.\nThat way none of us have to die……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705320"
msgid "I've done what I needed to do.\nI'll haul ass after I take a breather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705392"
msgid "………………well.\nPlaying friends with each other\nwasn't so boring after all, huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705480"
msgid "Oh, what's up, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nThat outfit sure takes me back.\nFelt like the preliminaries for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705592"
msgid "Eh? You found that in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? \nYou can really find anything over there, \ncan't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705708"
msgid "Did you catch that drama show yesterday?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705752"
msgid "I did, I did.\nI can't believe she was the actual culprit.\nThat was shocking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705832"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. And that dog was so dang cute.\nI wonder how they got 'em to act like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705920"
msgid "That final scene was foul play.\nAs if anyone wouldn't be moved\nby something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706008"
msgid "Hey, did you catch yesterday's news?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706048"
msgid "I did, I did.\nThey announced a Peace Prize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706092"
msgid "Yeah, yeah.\nThat company had pretty cool commercials,\ncan't believe it went bankrupt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706180"
msgid "There're lots of other awards,\nbut I'd like to get one too someday.\nI'll have to study a lot more then, huh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706292"
msgid "Yeah, yeah.\nNo matter what big company you work for,\nwhen it's time to jump ship, you jump ship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706392"
msgid "My chair has a leg that's not long enough.\nIt's always rattling and rattling,\nand it's pissing me off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706496"
msgid "Isn't this wack!?\nI SWEAR this shit is wack!\nI'm picky about adjusting my chair, man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706584"
msgid "When it's off by even a millimeter, I can't\nfocus. But I've been taking classes with THIS\nshit!? I'm tellin' you, it makes NO sense!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706720"
msgid "No sense…… no sense…… no sense, right?\nThis chair makes no sense, either……\nHey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF? Who, uh, are you again……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706860"
msgid "I feel like I'm forgetting something\nreally important.\nIt's right on the tip of my tongue……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706956"
msgid "This week, it's my turn to clean up\nthe classroom. I wanna go to the\narchery range and practice already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707064"
msgid "Guys are always ditching when it's\ntheir turn to clean.\nI wish they'd take this more seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707160"
msgid "I enter Classroom 2-A.\nI've had quite the morning, and all before homeroom started."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707244"
msgid "Heya, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, what's wrong?\nYou're cutting it pretty close this morning.\nDiligence is your only redeeming quality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707376"
msgid "C'mon, get off of that.\nIt's no place for plebs like you.\nWhat it IS is a place for chosen players……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707480"
msgid "Yep, it should only be a place for the\nhandful of Game Champs out there to speak\ntheir mind and gain followers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707592"
msgid "Get it? It's a bastion for the gifted―\nfor ME, the World Ranked #2,\nwith a current battle score of 78 million!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707704"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF. As you can see, he's like if you put\n\"overly self-conscious,\" \"elitist,\" and \"spotlight hog\"\ninto a blender and mixed it all into one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707872"
msgid "If you asked me how we've still\nmanaged to be friends after so many years,\nhere's how I would answer you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707980"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF may have personality issues,\nbut his grades in school and skill in gaming\nmeasure up to his big mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708108"
msgid "\"If only he could read the mood,\nthen people really would worship him.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708180"
msgid "…is what seems to be the consensus\nof all the girls in school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708244"
msgid "Also, the \"Piece Journal\" that #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is talking about\nis a massive European bulletin board system, PJ for short."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708376"
msgid "It's not a place for the typical sharing of information,\nbut a haunt for the deeper, self-proclaimed experts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708488"
msgid "Huh? Did you just laugh at me?\nSounds like you got something to say, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nBack up your complaining with SCORE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708616"
msgid "Oh, it's just I recently saw some hack n' slash\nfrom someone in person. Class society sure\nis cruel. I'll have to do some reassessment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708752"
msgid "……#C236196003Leo#CDEF directs a casual smile over to me.\nHe's referring to the incident by the stairs from earlier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708872"
msgid "A boy who just recently transferred to this school.\nHeir to a certain famous plutocracy,\nand a child prodigy who's skipped grades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709004"
msgid "I think…… the three of us went through\na major, shared experience together.\nThat experience is why we understand each other,\nbut what was it……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709152"
msgid "By the way, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nHave you heard the rumor that came up on PJ?\nThe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709284"
msgid "I'd say it's a pretty sketchy claim.\nWe don't know who's running it,\nwe don't even know how to participate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709392"
msgid "Stinks to high heaven, doesn't it?\nAnd the moderators just left it too,\nwhat a ridiculous story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709492"
msgid "But it's quite intriguing, isn't it.\n\"Grant any wish,\" they said?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709560"
msgid "A wish? Even if you ask,\nI can't just think of one off the top of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709636"
msgid "There are a lot of things I want,\nbut they're all \"things I can get if I work hard enough.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709728"
msgid "Is that so?\nThat's just like you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709788"
msgid "Of course. I transferred to\nTsukumihara for that purpose――\n――――Oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709864"
msgid "……that's strange. I transferred here\ndue to my father's circumstances……\nIsn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709960"
msgid "\"That's right,\" I answer.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF and his older brother both transferred\nto Tsukumihara about half a year ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710084"
msgid "Though I don't remember when I heard it,\nthe fact of it has definitely been recorded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710172"
msgid "Ohh, should we ask my brother #C236196003Julius#CDEF next?\nI'm sure that my older brother would\nhave an interesting wish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710296"
msgid "……hey, uh. Why'd you start talking\nabout your gloomy older brother?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710368"
msgid "Since we've been going around asking\nwhat wishes we have, naturally the next person\nyou should ask is ME!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710476"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF does all the driving for #C236196003Leo#CDEF to and from school\nand is kind of like a butler."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710596"
msgid "The entire student body goes crazy over the sight\nof him rolling up to the main gate in a #RUBS   luxury car#RUBERolls-Royce#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710728"
msgid "Uhh. Hey, are either of you listening to me?\nI'm the reigning game champion of all Asia!\nShouldn't you be more amazed by this?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "710856"
msgid "Yeah yeah, what would you wish for?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710892"
msgid "Hah, not too bright, are you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nEven though you're my friend,\nto not know even that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711000"
msgid "I only have one wish――\n\"To leave the most impressive#ROFS0001#RUBS  record#RUBE score#REND\nin the world, for all to see!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711124"
msgid "Uggh…… Damn, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nyou know where it hurts, don't you……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711204"
msgid "They're nothing but a scrub.\nAll they got is their massive playtime: one of\nthose \"addicted cheaters,\" as they're known."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711328"
msgid "When it comes to pure technique, judgement,\nand inspiration―I win by a landslide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711412"
msgid "I'll show you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nNext week, I'll oust #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF,\nand become the No.1 player for sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711556"
msgid "It's true the next campaign is where you'll have\nthe biggest advantage, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF. I wish you luck.\nLet's have a celebration if you reach No.1."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711716"
msgid "You bet! Did ya hear that, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nNext week, we're having a festival for #RUBS King Shinji#RUBE#C236196003Shinji#CDEF-OH#REND\nat #C236196003Leo#CDEF's place! Look forward to it, then!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711920"
msgid "As a matter of fact, as soon as the bell rings,\nyou can hear what's like a wild animal\nstomping in from the hallway……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712040"
msgid "Stomping in…… or not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712064"
msgid "――――The entire class gasps from this\nunexpected development."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712132"
msgid "The classroom goes dead silent.\nIt was someone we've never seen before,\nthat this school's never seen before,\na woman dressed as a Buddhist nun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712280"
msgid "Everyone is shocked by this woman's presence.\nWithout a word, our eyes follow her \nas she heads to the lectern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712392"
msgid "But my situation was quite a ways different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712440"
msgid "It was because I had an unexpected encounter\nwith this woman just a bit ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712520"
msgid "I'm so sorry for taking you all by surprise\nthis morning. I'm sure you're all very confused.\nI should introduce myself now, shouldn't I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712660"
msgid "The Buddhist nun acknowledges the\nentire class' bewilderment with calm… or rather, with cheer.\nThen, with a graceful motion, she bows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712796"
msgid "It would be my honor to do so from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712840"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF always starts with a contrarian stance,\nbut this time, he immediately turned into jelly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712952"
msgid "I guess #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has a soft spot for mature women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713020"
msgid "Regardless, it's no surprise that\neven #C236196003Shinji#CDEF would get entranced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713104"
msgid "Everything about this nun's……\n#C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF's appearance exudes purity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713196"
msgid "I guess one could even call her appearance…… affectionate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713260"
msgid "That voice, that posture, those eyes, that smile,\nall of that is saying that she means us well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713356"
msgid "There's a strange feeling of discomfort\nthat nips at me from the back of my neck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713440"
msgid "I feel like the name \"#C236196003Taiga Fujimura#CDEF\"\ncalls a far different image to mind……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713536"
msgid "I awkwardly greet her back, partly just because our eyes met."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713600"
msgid "And then―― she gave the greatest smile,\none that would melt whoever saw it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713680"
msgid "What a stroke of luck this is. Thank you\nso very much for earlier. I haven't been able\nto forget that heated embrace of yours……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713812"
msgid "Wh-why are you stealing a march on me!?\nHow do you already know #C236196003Ms. Taiga#CDEF!? And what's\nthis \"embrace\" thing you did earlier!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713956"
msgid "It means when lovers hold each other, right?\nBut that's far too assertive, almost feral\na behavior for a student to be having."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714084"
msgid "What're you doing, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIt's not cool to go for a teacher, ya know!?\nEven in manga they're always saying so!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714212"
msgid "With the critical damage from #C236196003Leo#CDEF's words,\nthe classroom turned into a melting pot of gossip."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714324"
msgid "There were girls with eyes sparkling from the gossip,\nthere were envious and fussing boys.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, resentful, cursed me under his breath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714480"
msgid "As I watched the uproar before me,\nthere stood #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF, warmly waving at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714580"
msgid "Looks like these ordinary days\nhave gone through some big changes……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714652"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714768"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714920"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715048"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715184"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715328"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715484"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715596"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715712"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715848"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715964"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716064"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716184"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716312"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716448"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716592"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716728"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716868"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716984"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717120"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717236"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717320"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717444"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717556"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717684"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717820"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717932"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718064"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718184"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718320"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718432"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718560"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718692"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

